# Play test of Skyhollow (CIPlay skyhollow, in a test world 'CI ...'): a flying island (60 m up; heights count from the
# island's own water line). No quest: the meadow, the hermit's chest, the boat in its hollow and its crate, down to the
# nesting ledge and up its ladder. Points as in its recipe.
island Skyhollow
offset 0 0
wait 3
at 0 -2
expect height 7
at -3.75 0.5 h=7
open The hermit's chest
at 9.5 5.5 h=5
open Crate in the boat
at 0 13 h=4
expect height 4
open Chest by the nests
climb 0 10.15 h=4
